### state: 0=斷線, 1=異常紅燈, 2=自動運行綠燈, 3=待機黃燈
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Apply sql/machine_history_log_state.sql first if state columns are absent.
### POST: state is optional (integer 0..3); omission stores NULL.
### Send "state": 2, never "state": "" or "state": "2" (400).
### PATCH: omit state to leave it unchanged; send "state": 0 to record disconnected.
POST {{baseUrl}}/headMachineHistoryLog/addHeadMachineHistoryLog
Content-Type: application/json

{"machineId": 1, "title": "Status", "log": "Started", "state": 2}

### GET list includes state; existing GET-by-id and GET-by-machine also include it.
GET {{baseUrl}}/headMachineHistoryLog/getHeadMachineHistoryLog

### PATCH: omitted/null fields remain unchanged; empty request returns 400, missing id returns 404.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/headMachineHistoryLog/updateHeadMachineHistoryLog/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"state": 3}

### Production flow: status/close/material/review accept optional integer state.
### productionStatus 生產中 overrides state to 2; all other supported production statuses override it to 3.
### start also creates history with state=2. Unmapped statuses use the supplied state (or NULL).
### The URL id is an assignment id. start does not create a machine history row.
POST {{baseUrl}}/workOrderHeadingMachine/1/production/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"productionStatus": "待維修", "reason": "模具損壞", "state": 3}

### Threading production flow uses the same state behavior.
POST {{baseUrl}}/workOrderThreadingMachine/1/production/status
Content-Type: application/json

{"productionStatus": "待維修", "reason": "牙板損壞", "state": 3}

### POST thread machine history
POST {{baseUrl}}/threadMachineHistoryLog/addThreadMachineHistoryLog
Content-Type: application/json

{"machineId": 1, "title": "Status", "log": "Started", "state": 2}

### GET thread machine history
GET {{baseUrl}}/threadMachineHistoryLog/getThreadMachineHistoryLog

### PATCH supports title, time, machineId, log, state independently.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/threadMachineHistoryLog/updateThreadMachineHistoryLog/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"state": 3}

### PUT replaces the row; machineId, time and state required; omitted title/log become NULL.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/headMachineHistoryLog/updateHeadMachineHistoryLog/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"machineId": 1, "time": "2026-10-28T08:00:00", "title": "生產中", "log": "Started", "state": 2}

### PUT replaces the row; machineId, time and state required; omitted title/log become NULL.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/threadMachineHistoryLog/updateThreadMachineHistoryLog/1
Content-Type: application/json

{"machineId": 1, "time": "2026-10-28T08:00:00", "title": "生產中", "log": "Started", "state": 2}

### production/close: orderClosed=1 writes log=正常結單; orderClosed=2 writes log=異常結單.
### Both close cases write state=2, including reviewer re-close; title retains production status.
